issue.body:
### Nixpkgs version

- Unstable (25.11)

### Describe the bug

https://discourse.nixos.org/t/overlay-with-overridden-fetchurl-to-access-resources/67131

I would like to override all instances of `fetchurl` to use a dynamically generated `netrc` file with the `netrcPhase` and associated options. This is incredibly important for enterprise adoption of Nix as it enables short lived tokens to be used as credentials in fetchers. However, this is not currently practical as the following results in an infrec error:
```nix
 final: prev: {
        foo = pkgs.hello;
        fetchurl =
          args:
          prev.fetchurl (
            args
            // {
              netrcPhase = ''
               BAR=''$(do-dynamic-stuff)
                cat > netrc <<EOF
                machine foobar
                        login FOO
                        password ''$BAR
                EOF
              '';
            }
          );
      };
```
This is because `fetchurl` depends on `cacert` which itself depends on `fetchurl`. The current workaround is to additionally override cacert as follows
```nix
(prev.fetchurl.override {
    inherit (pkgsOld) cacert;
})
```
but this is rather wasteful as we now have to deal with a second pristine instance of nixpkgs that must be used in `do-dynamic-stuff`. I am rather suprised at the infrec error as I though nix's lazy evaluation would allow it to work. I am raising this issue because I think overriding `fetchurl` in this manner, along with the nix config `extra-sandbox-paths` should be the default way to pass and use secrets in nix builds and it is important to make this ergonomic for enterprise use.

### Steps to reproduce

Run the following flake:
```nix
{
  inputs = {
    nixpkgs.url = "github:nixos/nixpkgs";
  };

  outputs =
    inputs:
    let
      system = "x86_64-linux";
      overlay = final: prev: {
        fetchurl =
          args:
          prev.fetchurl (
            args
            // {
              netrcPhase = ''
                cat > netrc <<EOF
                machine foobar
                        login FOO
                        password BAR
                EOF
              '';
            }
          );
      };
      pkgs = (inputs.nixpkgs.legacyPackages.${system}.extend overlay);
    in
    {
      packages.${system}.default = pkgs.fetchurl {
        url = "https://github.com/developit/unfetch/archive/refs/tags/isomorphic-4.0.2.tar.gz";
